le to offer assistance.\nCONTRIBUTING.md:143:After the checks in your pull request pass, someone will review your code.\nCONTRIBUTING.md:148:When the pull request is approved, it will be merged into the `master` branch.\nCONTRIBUTING.md:155:Rich receives a growing number of AI-written issues and pull requests, and new\nCONTRIBUTING.md:157:contributors, whether or not you use AI yourself.\nCONTRIBUTING.md:168:4. Pull requests follow [AI_POLICY.md](AI_POLICY.md): fill in the template,\nCONTRIBUTING.md:186:  issue or copy the bot's comment into a new issue or pull request.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
